Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: Repeatedly substituting T(n) = 2T(n/2) + cn into itself builds a recursion tree in which every level costs exactly cn, so the total cost is cn times the number of levels (lg n + 1), i.e. Θ(n lg n).
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): Doubling the number of nodes while halving each node's cost keeps every level at exactly cn, so the total is cn times the number of levels — and doubling n adds exactly one level, which is why the number of levels is lg n.
DEMO STEPS: 6 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

FULL BLUEPRINT:
{
